💭 The diagnostic app as a real server, for the wire tests. It uses the package the
💭 way an application does, through its exported classes only.
💭
💭   PORT                      the port to listen on                  (default 8080)
💭   GRAPEVINE_TEST_SETTINGS   settings as key=value,key=value        (default none)
💭
💭 A setting that cannot be read is passed on as it stands, so the server refuses to
💭 start and says which one it was, instead of running with a limit the test did not ask for.
💭
💭 Built into build/bin/wire-host.
